WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.568
Watch and read: How should you turn pages?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.763
The answer is: gently. Books help us learn when we care for them.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:12.307
Watch and read: Blend the sounds c - a - t. What word do they make?

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:16.871
The answer is: cat. Say the sounds in order and blend smoothly.
